      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>第<span class=\"katex math inline\">1</span>行有<span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span>个整数<span class=\"katex math inline\">N,M</span>，表示物品的种类和背包的容积；</p>\n<p>第<span class=\"katex math inline\">2-N+1</span>行，每行有<span class=\"katex math inline\">3</span>个整数<span class=\"katex math inline\">Vi</span>，<span class=\"katex math inline\">Wi</span>，<span class=\"katex math inline\">Pi</span>，分别表示每个物品的体积，价值，个数。（体积&lt;=5000,价值&lt;=5000,个数&lt;=1000）</p>\n</div>            </div>",
